# Third-Party Notices

Applications that ship binaries from this **sesame-dependencies** package
(`{{package}}`) include the third-party software listed below. The full
license text of each component is installed under `licenses/<component>/`.

Downstream applications must reproduce these notices and license texts in
their own distribution, for example in an "Open Source Licenses" screen or in
a file shipped alongside the binaries.

This file is generated from the package's component records
(`share/sesame-deps/components/*.json`) and `licenses/components.json` in the
sesame-dependencies repository. Do not edit it by hand.

